<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Read-Rite said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Read-Rite said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised its rating of Read-Rite Corp to a buy from its prior rating of accumulate, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- Read Rite shares closed at 16-13/16 on Monday.</p>
</text>
